    "params": [
      {
        "name": "deadends",
        "type": "String[]"
      },
      {
        "name": "target",
        "type": "String"
      }
    ],
    "returns": "int"
  },
  "starter_code": "class Solution {\n    public int openLock(String[] deadends, String target) {\n        // TODO: write your solution here\n        return 0;\n    }\n}\n",
  "hints": [
    "Each code is a node with 8 neighbors (4 wheels \u00d7 up or down).",
    "Breadth-first search from \"0000\", never entering a deadend. If \"0000\" is itself a deadend, the answer is -1.",
    "if '0000' in dead: return -1\nqueue = [('0000', 0)]\nseen = {'0000'}\nwhile queue:\n    code, d = pop front\n    if code == target: return d\n    for each of the 8 neighbors not in dead or seen: add to seen, push (nb, d + 1)\nreturn -1",
    "There are only 10^4 codes, so BFS is O(10^4 \u00d7 8) at most."
  ],
  "expected_complexity": {
    "time": "O(10^4)",
    "space": "O(10^4)"
  },
